<title>USA: General Chemical sets stock buyback.</title>
<headline>General Chemical sets stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>HAMPTON, N.H. 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Chemical Group Inc said Thursday that its board has authorized the repurchase of up to 1.5 million shares of the company's common stock over time in the open market or in private transactions.</p>
<p>General Chemical Group is a diversified producer of chemicals and related services.</p>
